:: 诺斯塔启程
<<set $tower to setup.newTower()>>
<<goto "诺斯塔之塔">>

:: 诺斯塔之塔
<<nobr>>
<<set _rooms to $tower.version === 2 ? setup.towerRooms : setup.towerRoomsLegacy>>
<<set _room to _rooms[$tower.floor]>>
<div class="tower-shell" @data-era="$tower.era">
<header class="tower-heading">
<div class="tower-heading-top"><span class="tower-kicker">NOUSTA’S TOWER</span><span class="tower-floor">F<<print String($tower.floor + 1).padStart(2,'0')>> / 11</span></div>
<div class="tower-heading-bottom"><p class="tower-era"><<print $tower.era === 'past' ? '◈ 过去 · 炉火尚未熄灭' : '◇ 现在 · 风穿过荒塔'>></p><h1><<print _room.name>></h1></div>
</header>
<div class="tower-statusbar" aria-label="随身资源"><span>时光杖 · 无限往返</span><<if $tower.loot>><span>护符 · 剩余 <<print $tower.charges>> / 3 次</span><</if>></div>
<div class="tower-layout">
<main class="tower-main">
<<if $tower.ending>>
<section class="ending-card tower-ending">
<p class="tower-kicker">旅程终章</p>
<h2>结局 · <<print setup.towerEndingTitle($tower)>></h2>
<p><<print $tower.message>></p>
<p class="nousta-small">探索了 <<print $tower.visited.length>> / 22 个时态场景，留下 <<print $tower.notes.length>> 条手记。</p>
<p class="nousta-small">想试试另一种选择，可用侧栏的回退按钮返回结局前。需要保留这次旅程，请先存档。</p>
</section>
<<else>>
<div class="tower-objective"><span class="tower-kicker">此刻的线索</span><p><<print setup.towerObjective($tower)>></p></div>
<<if $tower.message>><p class="tower-feedback" role="status"><<print $tower.message>></p><</if>>
<div class="tower-prose"><p><<print setup.towerDescription($tower)>></p></div>
<h2 class="tower-section-title">你的下一步 <span aria-hidden="true">——</span></h2>
<nav class="tower-actions" aria-label="场景行动">
<<for _action range setup.towerActions($tower)>>
<<capture _action>>
<div class="tower-action-card" @data-kind="_action.kind || 'travel'">
<<link _action.label>><<set $tower to setup.towerAct($tower, _action.id)>><<goto "诺斯塔之塔">><</link>>
<<if _action.cost>><p class="tower-action-cost"><<print _action.cost>></p><</if>>
<<if _action.hint>><p class="tower-action-hint"><<print _action.hint>></p><</if>>
</div>
<</capture>>
<</for>>
</nav>
<details class="tower-panel tower-hints"><summary>查看解谜提示 <span>会说明解法与缺少的条件</span></summary><p><<print _room.hint>></p>
<<set _blocked to setup.towerBlocked($tower)>>
<<if _blocked.length>><ul><<for _reason range _blocked>><li><<print _reason>></li><</for>></ul><</if>>
</details>
<</if>>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>玩法与改编来源</summary><p>留意同一间屋子在过去与现在的不同，就能找到登塔的办法。任何角色都能走完本篇，关键线索无需掷骰；切换时代、查看手记都不扣生命或金币。随身物品和手记会跟你往返，已用掉的物品不会因切换时代而恢复。<<if $tower.version === 2>>留在机关上的绳索或巨剑也不会回到行囊。行动卡片会标明消耗，防火盾可以重复使用。<<else>>行动文字会注明消耗：符文优先于护符，防火盾优先于卷轴。<</if>>侧栏可以存档、读档或回退，抵达结局后也能回退尝试其他选择。</p><p>改编自 Jaclyn Lewis 的 <a href="https://jaclynlewis.itch.io/ascend-noustas-tower" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ascend Nousta’s Tower</a>（2023）。中文叙事、路线与结局有改写；本篇改编内容采用 <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>。</p></details>
<<if $tower.ending>><div class="nousta-start-link"><<link "返回标题，重新开始">><<run Engine.restart()>><</link>></div><</if>>
</main>
<aside class="tower-journal" aria-label="探险记录">
<details class="tower-panel tower-map-panel" open><summary>探索地图 · <<print $tower.visited.length>> / 22</summary>
<div class="tower-map-legend"><span>楼层</span><span>过去 / 现在</span></div>
<ol class="tower-map" reversed>
<<for _i to _rooms.length - 1; _i gte 0; _i-->>
<li @class="_i === $tower.floor ? 'is-current' : ''" @aria-current="_i === $tower.floor ? 'location' : 'false'">
<span class="tower-map-number"><<print String(_i + 1).padStart(2,'0')>></span><span class="tower-map-name"><<if $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':past') or $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':present')>><<print _rooms[_i].name>><<else>>未知的房间<</if>></span><span class="tower-map-dots"><span @aria-label="$tower.visited.includes(_i + ':past') ? '过去已探索' : '过去未探索'"><<print $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':past') ? '●' : '○'>></span> <span @aria-label="$tower.visited.includes(_i + ':present') ? '现在已探索' : '现在未探索'"><<print $tower.visited.includes(_i + ':present') ? '●' : '○'>></span></span></li>
<</for>></ol>
<p class="nousta-small">每层有过去、现在两个场景。上下楼不改变时代；转动时光杖不改变楼层。</p>
</details>
<details class="tower-panel" open><summary>随身物品</summary>
<ul class="tower-inventory"><<for _item range setup.towerInventory($tower)>><li><strong><<print _item.label>></strong><span><<print _item.detail>></span></li><</for>></ul>
</details>
<details class="tower-panel"><summary>探险手记 · <<print $tower.notes.length>> 条线索</summary>
<<if $tower.notes.length>><ol class="tower-notes"><<for _note range $tower.notes>><li><<print _note>></li><</for>></ol><<else>><p>手记还是空白。读书或调查时，你会把找到的线索记在这里。</p><</if>>
</details>
</aside>
</div>
</div>
<</nobr>>
